<title>CANADA: CWB says shipping one ship load of wheat to US PNW.</title>
<headline>CWB says shipping one ship load of wheat to US PNW.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board said Wednesday it is shipping an &quot;average sized&quot; cargo load of wheat to Portland via Burlington Northern Santa Fe Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;We're sending an average sized cargo through Portland. This is the first one. We'll continue to look at the PNW (Pacific Northwest),&quot; CWB spokeswoman Rhea Yates told Reuters.</p>
</text>
